tch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108170.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-17T17:03:40Z"},"body":"I was grepping through the codebase to find where the helper function that returns `res://.godot/editor` was, and didn't find these parts of the codebase when I searched for `\".godot\"` since the actual constant is `\"godot\"`. Once I found it, I thought it would be nice to have comments here, so that people can grep for these strings to find it. Then, I realized that my search for `\".godot\"` led me to two places in the tests where this is hard-coded, so I replaced those.\r\n\r\nWhile making this PR, I also noticed that `DirAccess::make_dir_recursive` doesn't properly handle `res://` paths, so I have to call `ProjectSettings::globalize_path` first, but I wonder if that's a bug and DirAccess should be fixed?","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108170/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/god